## Design Principles

The MCP Server should expose BUSINESS CAPABILITIES instead of DATABASE OPERATIONS.

The MCP Server should be reusable by multiple AI Workers.

The Knowledge Engine should remain the single owner of business logic.

The MCP Server should remain a thin protocol adapter.

Produce an implementation-ready RFC.
